      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Talking Video (LongCat Avatar 1.6)\n\nA start image, a prompt and speech in; a talking video as long as the speech out, in 93-frame segments (3.7 s at 25 fps), each continuing from the last 13 frames of the one before. One speaker. Give clean speech without music. Keep the prompt calm, with small expressions.\n\nSize: pick the 480p bucket closest to the picture's shape, such as 512x768 for portrait or 768x512 for landscape. The video is encoded with x264; this image has no NVENC.\n\nBuilt from the distilled example of PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-LongCat-Avatar (GPL-3.0). Model: Meituan's LongCat-Video-Avatar 1.6, MIT, int8 ConvRot file from PedroMarinhoDev/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.6-ComfyUI. Text encoder and VAE are Wan 2.1's. The Whisper encoder is saved as `whisper_large_v3_encoder_only_fp16`, since WanVideoWrapper's HuMo example puts a full Whisper model under the pack's name. Profile `longcat-avatar`.\n\n## Adding a LoRA\n\nA LoRA loader sits between the model loader and the sampler, bypassed, so nothing is applied by default. Pick a file in its `lora_name` box and press Ctrl+B on it to switch it on. The file goes in `models/loras/`.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Talking Video (LongCat Avatar 1.6)\n\nA start image, a prompt and speech in; a talking video as long as the speech out, in 93-frame segments (3.7 s at 25 fps), each continuing from the last 13 frames of the one before. One speaker. Give clean speech without music. Keep the prompt calm, with small expressions.\n\nSize: pick the 480p bucket closest to the picture's shape, such as 512x768 for portrait or 768x512 for landscape. The video is encoded with x264; this image has no NVENC.\n\nBuilt from the distilled example of PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-LongCat-Avatar (GPL-3.0). Model: Meituan's LongCat-Video-Avatar 1.6, MIT, int8 ConvRot file from PedroMarinhoDev/LongCat-Video-Avatar-1.6-ComfyUI. Text encoder and VAE are Wan 2.1's. The Whisper encoder is saved as `whisper_large_v3_encoder_only_fp16`, since WanVideoWrapper's HuMo example puts a full Whisper model under the pack's name. Profile `longcat-avatar`.\n\n## Adding a LoRA\n\nA LoRA loader sits between the model loader and the sampler, bypassed, so nothing is applied by default. Pick a file in its `lora_name` box and press Ctrl+B on it to switch it on. The file goes in `models/loras/`.\n"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
